                            <comment id="16997982" author="pavlukhin" created="Tue, 17 Dec 2019 08:21:46 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;There are same problems for Cache 6 suite in master as well (&lt;a href=&quot;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/buildConfiguration/IgniteTests24Java8_Cache6?branch=%3Cdefault%3E&amp;amp;buildTypeTab=overview&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/buildConfiguration/IgniteTests24Java8_Cache6?branch=%3Cdefault%3E&amp;amp;buildTypeTab=overview&lt;/a&gt;). Should be addressed separately.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
